---
seoTitle: "SCIPS: support for tenants, residents and community groups in Sandwell"
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: "SCIPS is a community-led charity in West Bromwich helping tenants, residents and community groups across Sandwell have a say on their homes and neighbourhoods."
heroSlides: ["6815366", "7470106", "7457170", "6345055"]
tasks:
  - title: Start a tenants' and residents' association
    desc: Bring neighbours together and set your group up properly
    url: /residents-groups/#starting
  - title: Get support for an existing group
    desc: Constitutions, meetings, AGMs, money and funding
    url: /residents-groups/#running
  - title: Have your say on housing in Sandwell
    desc: Forums, panels and groups that residents can join
    url: /get-involved/
  - title: Training for committee members and volunteers
    desc: Build the skills to run meetings and represent your area
    url: /how-we-help/#training
  - title: Get help with an issue in your area
    desc: Support to raise a problem with the people who can fix it
    url: /how-we-help/#advocacy
situations:
  - label: Group support
    quote: Bins, fly-tipping, broken lights. You've reported it again and again and nothing changes.
    how: We help neighbours raise issues together as a group, so they reach the right people and get a proper answer.
  - label: Starting a group
    quote: You want to start a residents' group but have no idea where to begin.
    how: We'll take you through it from the first meeting to a constitution, committee and bank account.
  - label: Consultation
    quote: Your group has been asked for its views on a housing plan and the paperwork is a lot.
    how: We explain what's being asked in plain English and help you get your group's response in.
  - label: Training
    quote: You've just become chair or treasurer and nobody has shown you what to do.
    how: Training for committee members and volunteers, so you feel confident in the role.
  - label: Building safety
    quote: You live in a high-rise block and have questions about fire, gas or water safety.
    how: We can point you to the Resident Building Safety Forum and help you put your questions.
  - label: Advocacy
    quote: Something isn't right with your home and you don't feel listened to.
    how: We help you set out your case clearly and take it to the people who can put it right.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import arrow, prev, pause %}

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="kicker">Community-led charity in Sandwell</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">Helping Sandwell residents have a say in their <em>homes and neighbourhoods</em></h1>

    <div class="hero__layout">
      <div class="slideshow" data-slideshow aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Photographs of Sandwell">
        <div class="slideshow__frame">
          {% for id in heroSlides %}
          <div class="slideshow__slide{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="{{ loop.index }} of {{ heroSlides.length }}"{% if not loop.first %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
            {% picture id, "(min-width: 60em) 62vw, 100vw", { loading: ("eager" if loop.first else "lazy") } %}
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="slideshow__bar">
          <div class="slideshow__captions credit" aria-live="off">
            {% for id in heroSlides %}<p{% if loop.first %} class="is-active"{% endif %}>{% credit id %}</p>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="slideshow__controls">
            <span data-slideshow-count>1 / {{ heroSlides.length }}</span>
            <button class="icon-button" type="button" data-slideshow-toggle aria-label="Pause slideshow">{{ pause() | safe }}</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__aside">
        <p class="lede">We support tenants, residents and community groups to come together, get organised and be heard by the people who make decisions about where they live.</p>
        <div class="button-group">
          <a class="button button--brand" href="/residents-groups/">Start a residents' group {{ arrow() | safe }}</a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="/how-we-help/">See how we help {{ arrow() | safe }}</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__contact">Talk to us on <strong><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></strong><br>{{ site.hours }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="tasks-title">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="span-4">
      <h2 id="tasks-title">How can we help?</h2>
      <p class="mt-s muted">Choose what you'd like to do. If you're not sure, call us and we'll talk it through.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="span-8">
      <ol class="task-list">
        {% for t in tasks %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ t.url }}">
            <span class="task-list__num">{{ "0" + loop.index }}</span>
            <span><span class="task-list__title">{{ t.title }}</span><span class="task-list__desc">{{ t.desc }}</span></span>
            <span class="task-list__arrow">{{ arrow() | safe }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container intro-split">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">About SCIPS</p>
      <h2 id="about-title" class="mt-s">Run by local people, for local people</h2>
      <div class="prose mt-m">
        <p>SCIPS is a charity led and governed by the community. We help residents build a sense of belonging and pride in their neighbourhoods, and make sure their views reach the people who make decisions.</p>
        <p>We work with tenants' and residents' associations, community groups and individual residents across Sandwell, alongside Sandwell Council and local housing providers.</p>
        <p><a class="arrow-link" href="/about/">More about us</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>Area</dt><dd>Borough of Sandwell</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Office</dt><dd>West Bromwich, and community venues across the borough</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Open</dt><dd>{{ site.hours }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Referral</dt><dd>Not needed. Contact us directly</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Charity no.</dt><dd><a href="{{ site.charityRegister }}">{{ site.charityNumber }}</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--green" aria-labelledby="strategy-title">
  <div class="container band__grid">
    <div>
      <h2 id="strategy-title">We helped shape how Sandwell Council works with its tenants</h2>
      <p>The council's Tenant Engagement Strategy was written by a group of nine tenants, SCIPS and the council's housing team, working together.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <blockquote class="quote">
        <p>“…our key partner, Sandwell Community Information and Participation Services (SCIPS)”</p>
        <cite>Sandwell Council, Tenant Engagement Strategy</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-m"><a class="arrow-link" href="{{ site.strategy }}">Read the strategy on sandwell.gov.uk</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="situations-title" data-carousel>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="carousel__head">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <h2 id="situations-title">Things we can help with</h2>
        <p>Some of the situations residents and groups come to us about.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__nav" hidden>
        <button class="icon-button" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous">{{ prev() | safe }}</button>
        <span data-carousel-status aria-live="polite">1 of {{ situations.length }}</span>
        <button class="icon-button" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next">{{ arrow() | safe }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="carousel__track" data-carousel-track tabindex="0" aria-label="Situations we help with. Scroll sideways to see more.">
      {% for s in situations %}
      <li class="carousel__item">
        <span class="label">{{ s.label }}</span>
        <blockquote>{{ s.quote }}</blockquote>
        <p class="how"><strong>How we help</strong>{{ s.how }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ruled" aria-labelledby="area-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="area-title">Working across the borough</h2>
      <p>Our office is in West Bromwich, and we meet residents in local venues across Oldbury, Rowley Regis, Smethwick, Tipton and Wednesbury.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-grid">
      {% for id in ["7470106", "6815360", "7457154", "7476781", "5783648"] %}
      <figure class="figure">
        {% picture id, "(min-width: 48em) 50vw, 100vw" %}
        <figcaption>{% credit id %}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ruled" aria-labelledby="guides-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="carousel__head">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <h2 id="guides-title">Guides for residents' groups</h2>
        <p>Plain-English guides you can read online or print for your committee.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="arrow-link" href="/guides/">All guides</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="guides-strip">
      {% for g in collections.guide | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}
      <li><a href="{{ g.url }}"><span>Guide {{ loop.index }} · {{ g.data.readingTime }}</span><strong>{{ g.data.title }}</strong><span>{{ g.data.summary }}</span></a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="container visit">
    <div>
      <h2 id="contact-title">Talk to us</h2>
      <p class="lede mt-s">You don't need a referral. Get in touch and tell us what's happening where you live.</p>
      <dl class="facts mt-l">
        <div><dt>Call</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Open</dt><dd>{{ site.hours }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Visit</dt><dd>{% for line in site.address %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="button-group mt-l"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Send us a message {{ arrow() | safe }}</a></div>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/map.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
